== Description ==
Increases profits. Grants a [[Sources|Mana Source]] and Spell Shards periodically with period based on number of sources owned. Passively increases your attributes.

Gains experience each second, depending on Character's level.

== Pet Ability ==


Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>P \times L \times 5 + 1</math>


increases all attributes (except Versatility) by:
<br><math>\left\lfloor 2 \times \frac{L}{3} \right\rceil + 1</math>
<br>If over 150, instead increases by:
<br><math>\left\lfloor \left( \left\lfloor 2 \times \frac{L}{3} \right\rceil - 149 \right)^{0.5} \right\rceil + 150</math>

Ability activates every:
<br><math>\left\lfloor \frac{S^{0.45}}{P} \right\rceil</math>
<br>seconds (minimum 1).

On ability activation, grants 1 source whose cost does not exceed:
<br><math>M \times 1\,000</math>
<br>''Note: Chooses from sources with at least one manual purchase.''

On ability activation, grants spell shards equal to:
<br><math>P \times L^{1.35} \times 2</math>
<br>If it would grant more than <math>10^7</math> shards, it instead grants:
<br><math>\left( P \times L^{1.35} \times 2 - 10^7 \right)^{0.25} + 10^7</math>

where:
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>S = \text{Bought Mana Sources}</math>
* <math>M = \text{All Mana this Realm}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Accrues experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left( \frac{C}{100} + F + 1 \right) \times M</math>

This XP pool is distributed over time, at a rate each second of:
<br><math>1 + \frac{X}{10}</math>

where:
* <math>C = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>X = \text{Accrued Pet XP}</math>

